    <a href="#" class="overlay-close" data-modal-close aria-label="Close about the project">Close</a>
    <h2 id="about-title">About the Project</h2>
    <p>Queen’s Triad is a speculative planetary archive set on Maia IV, a fictional Federation world. It uses narrative distance to explore healing, adaptation, identity, xenoanthropology, personal growth, and life beyond scarcity.</p>
    <p>The project expands the speculative worldbuilding of <a href="https://usskepler.org">USS Kepler</a> and sits alongside the civic thought experiments of <a href="https://aureliareach.org">Aurelia Reach</a> and the essays published through <a href="https://www.amidthenoise.com">Amid the Noise</a>. Queen’s Triad is not an escape from human experience. It is a place to consider what becoming means when survival is no longer the work.</p>
    <p>Responses, questions, and better frames are welcome at <a href="mailto:info@queenstriad.org?subject=Queen%E2%80%99s%20Triad%20Project">info@queenstriad.org</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

